WEBVTT

00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:31.752
i zaboli kolac

00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:33.288
i gde god da zabodu taj kolac,

00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:34.996
to bi bio njihov novi dom.

00:00:34.996 --> 00:00:37.366
A na samom kraju prvog dana,

00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:39.116
populacija Oklahoma Sitija

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:43.022
porasla je sa 0 na 10.000

00:00:43.022 --> 00:00:45.163
a Direkcija za planiranje i izgradnju

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:48.283
još uvek plaća za to.

00:00:48.283 --> 00:00:50.780
Građani su se okupili tog prvog dana

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.032
i izabrali gradonačelnika.

00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:54.839
A onda su ga upucali.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.488
(Smeh)

00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:02.430
To i nije baš toliko smešno